Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.39,0:00:17.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The End of the Sea Did you know there's an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:20.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,awesome treasure hidden\Nat the end of the sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.35,0:00:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And anyone who finds it,\Nthe King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.07,0:00:24.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that exciting or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.61,0:00:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are incredible adventures\Nout there just waiting for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.99,0:00:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.47,0:00:35.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have the courage that sail and believe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.49,0:00:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we will see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.09,0:00:40.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A glimpse of the sun rising?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.79,0:00:43.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On our tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.41,0:00:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back when we first started.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.25,0:00:50.43,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Video Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.25,0:00:50.43,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}Feeso
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.97,0:00:50.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We had separate horizons.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.77,0:00:53.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sailed toward different dreams.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.80,0:00:55.72,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Graphics
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.80,0:00:55.72,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}Datenshi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.23,0:00:55.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things have changed now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.55,0:00:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For together we found.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.81,0:01:01.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Quality Control
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.81,0:01:01.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}Galaxy 9000\NPepperjack\NPhosCity\NScolines\NZenef
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.45,0:01:00.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We look through the spyglass and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.15,0:01:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we know that our hearts\Nhave brought us here.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.06,0:01:07.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Karaoke
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.06,0:01:07.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}KaitouYahiko
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.69,0:01:09.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the conscious points our destiny.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.82,0:01:11.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Soundtracking
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.82,0:01:11.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.33,0:01:13.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no looking back,\Ntake the hell with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.31,0:01:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage, we can't\Nstop all our troubles.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.43,0:01:19.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.41,0:01:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though the future's\Nunclear, we still can smile.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.83,0:01:27.46,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Timing/Typesetting
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.83,0:01:27.46,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}Gab
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.39,0:01:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know we'll get there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.05,0:01:28.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No regrets.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.46,0:01:31.51,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\bord3\pos(24,113)}Subtitle Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.46,0:01:31.51,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(67.02,153.65)}Gordingus\NPollychan
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.39,0:01:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every tear that we've cried only helps.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.49,0:01:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our dreams come true.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.59,0:01:37.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\bord3\pos(964,111.4)}Translation
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.59,0:01:37.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(1007.02,152.05)}Funimation\NLP\NPamkinPinguin
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.39,0:01:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and those dreams\Nare precious in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.39,0:01:46.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A glimpse of the sun\Nrising on our tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.45,0:01:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, do you mind if I call you, Issie?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.45,0:01:59.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you really tell which way the\Ngravity blue rider's ship is heading?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.19,0:02:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.11,0:02:07.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even from this far away, you can hear the\Nsound of their voices inside the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.03,0:02:10.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But are you sure you're feeling all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.49,0:02:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been trembling ever\Nsince we picked you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.39,0:02:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just... It's just that I've\Nnever been this afraid before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.23,0:02:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's voices, everyone's\Nvoices keep disappearing one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.13,0:02:31.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm sorry, we've got to hurry, Conis.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.97,0:02:34.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.13,0:02:38.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm finally a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.97,0:02:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think instead of looking for the\Nothers, I'll just look for the gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.77,0:02:44.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was your shock, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.51,0:02:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That place over there seems like\Na good spot for gold to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.87,0:02:53.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.51,0:02:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe the others will end up there, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.69,0:03:12.53,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9\fad(309,0)\bord2\c&HF9F9F9&\1a&HFF&\t(268,309,\1a&H00&)}Pirate Robin vs. Abbot Yama
Dialogue: 2,0:03:07.69,0:03:12.53,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9\fad(309,0)\c&HF9F9F9&\bord0\4a&HFF&}Pirate Robin vs. Abbot Yama
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.47,0:03:13.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.67,0:03:15.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.55,0:03:17.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I've got to locate Enero.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.89,0:03:19.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't leave a lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.17,0:03:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a lone way out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.75,0:03:22.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already said I was sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.81,0:03:25.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to\Nexplain my suspicions,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.53,0:03:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I fear that my men's\Nlives may be in great danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.25,0:03:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, this whole land may be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.27,0:03:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pierre, can you fly? Pierre!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.21,0:03:37.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.25,0:03:41.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there, you heartless brute!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.73,0:03:42.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.03,0:03:44.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you call yourself a god!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.57,0:03:45.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.55,0:03:46.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think this over!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.61,0:04:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess the main thing now would be\Nto give these guys some first aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.33,0:04:02.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are still alive, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.73,0:04:05.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Chopper, hurry up and get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.63,0:04:07.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! What? What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.85,0:04:15.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hazel!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.93,0:04:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Conis?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.87,0:04:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hazel!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.85,0:04:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And her dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.45,0:04:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.41,0:04:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And would you knock it off\Nwith that horn already?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.95,0:04:35.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.45,0:04:39.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, no, you mustn't go. Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.43,0:04:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't go into the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.27,0:04:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.18,0:04:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise we'll only\Nstay for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.05,0:04:46.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.97,0:04:49.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, this young lady is Issie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.11,0:04:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand back, you blue sea\Ndevil, or I'll smash you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.95,0:04:54.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a brave warrior of Shandora!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.29,0:04:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's nice, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.20,0:04:56.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to fight me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.21,0:04:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a face full of impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.55,0:04:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.57,0:04:59.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've been burnt black.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.71,0:05:00.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They need first aid at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.07,0:05:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At any rate, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.85,0:05:06.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, quick, turn your ship\Nup the path we just came on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.57,0:05:09.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We used a milky dial\Nto create a new river.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.39,0:05:12.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you follow it, you can exit\Ndirectly to the White White Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.53,0:05:14.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quick, before the enemy\Nrealizes we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.83,0:05:17.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then shouldn't you have been\Na little quieter getting here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.63,0:05:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way, I almost forgot\NI brought something to give you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.67,0:05:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.01,0:06:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.27,0:06:10.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or were you still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.23,0:06:22.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.41,0:06:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I must have dozed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.07,0:06:26.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.31,0:06:28.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem to be in pain
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.89,0:06:32.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've kept my promise, haven't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.51,0:06:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't moved a muscle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.89,0:06:37.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.01,0:06:43.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beat you, can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.63,0:06:49.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.81,0:06:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.85,0:06:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am living lightning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.45,0:07:01.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try as you might, no mere man\Ncan defeat such divine power.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.39,0:07:06.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely as a native of the sky you've seen\Nit flashing in the distance, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.33,0:07:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since ancient times,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.85,0:07:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,men have trembled before the unknown forces\Nof nature and worshipped them as God.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.07,0:07:16.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything the fools could not understand\Nreduced them to abject terror.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.37,0:07:20.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens to mankind,\Nwhether for good or for evil,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.97,0:07:22.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it is said to be the work of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.91,0:07:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.03,0:07:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mankind accepts that it can never\Ndefeat the disasters of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.89,0:07:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.29,0:07:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.71,0:07:44.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, a breath dialing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.97,0:07:47.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bird blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.23,0:08:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to tell Wiper, we\Ncan't win this battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.77,0:08:19.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.55,0:08:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if he sacrifices himself,\Nthe reject won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.93,0:08:25.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late to run now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.83,0:08:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to fall back and regroup.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.89,0:08:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or else...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.83,0:08:30.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or else...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.05,0:08:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you think that you could\Nmove faster than lightning?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.97,0:08:45.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your five minutes are up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.41,0:08:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.77,0:09:00.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One million volt body.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.19,0:09:02.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,WIPER!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.17,0:09:32.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.71,0:09:42.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.49,0:09:44.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.61,0:09:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.19,0:09:48.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The voices!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.49,0:09:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're disappearing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.21,0:10:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, I guess my electricity\Ntraveled down the Milky Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.71,0:10:05.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another 20 voices vanished\Nafter that lightning bolt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.67,0:10:08.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stupid fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.81,0:10:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the upper yard, 81 people\Nbegan the survival game.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.81,0:10:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two hours have passed. Of that\Neighty-one, fifty-six have fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.63,0:10:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thirteen of my divine squad still remain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.59,0:10:36.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five members of the Straw\NHat crew are still with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.23,0:10:39.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And seven warriors of Shandora.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.57,0:10:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means there are twenty-five\Nplayers still in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.13,0:10:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a lot more survivors\Nthan I predicted there would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.17,0:10:49.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.53,0:10:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll all fall in their\Nturn, one right after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.41,0:10:57.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only real question remaining\Nis, who will come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.13,0:11:03.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.77,0:11:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're incredible, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.71,0:11:10.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's all yours now and as good as new!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.93,0:11:11.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.13,0:11:15.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you did, but I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.35,0:11:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This thing is so fast, it's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.75,0:11:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.66,0:11:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And jet dials went extinct\Nhundreds of years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.57,0:11:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really quite astonishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.59,0:11:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imagine how shocked I was to find\None aboard the Waver you left.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.73,0:11:31.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fear we're running out of\Nthings to occupy ourselves with.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.17,0:11:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We had planned to lead all\Nof you to the end of Skypiea,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.11,0:11:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it seems our\Ncircumstances have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.69,0:11:39.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess the best thing\Nto do is get the ship
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.85,0:11:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to the coast where we all agreed to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.93,0:11:43.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's really no reason to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.57,0:11:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.09,0:11:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, when the four of\Nthose goofballs get together,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.95,0:11:49.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's practically no stopping them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.49,0:11:51.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There aren't any four-man groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.41,0:11:55.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the most, there's maybe two.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.63,0:12:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there were a four-man group on the\Nisland, I'd know about it, and I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.49,0:12:01.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Mantara.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.49,0:12:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the power that Enel\Nand his priests use, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.71,0:12:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was born able to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.85,0:12:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.76,0:12:11.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's why I'm so afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.41,0:12:16.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no idea how scary it\Nis to hear voices disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.03,0:12:18.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not crying again, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.67,0:12:22.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not crying, you\Nstupid blue sea person!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.05,0:12:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her waiver had broken down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.79,0:12:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luckily, our boat happened to pass by.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.01,0:12:30.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we hadn't gotten to her when we did,\Nshe would have been eaten by a sky shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.73,0:12:33.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What were you thinking\Ncoming out here by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.69,0:12:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but I couldn't keep\Nsitting around doing nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.83,0:12:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucky, and everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.77,0:12:50.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope everyone is all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.29,0:13:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, what a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.73,0:13:09.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is crappy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.15,0:13:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starving and I left my\Nbag outside this stupid cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.61,0:13:16.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And all the fruit trees\Naround here are rotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.17,0:13:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And all I can think about is eating\Nthat yummy breakfast Sanji made.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.63,0:13:23.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of messed up cave\Ndid I wind up in anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.81,0:13:25.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't find the exit anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.37,0:13:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if everybody's already\Nmade it to this city of gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.55,0:13:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet it's all pretty and\Nshiny and golden and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.65,0:13:36.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they probably make all\Nkinds of good food there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.21,0:13:38.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to get there and find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.63,0:13:52.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I could've been walking forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.81,0:13:55.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'll have that lunch now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.61,0:14:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.91,0:14:09.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, fellow, but I don't speak bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.19,0:14:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's my food you're after,\Nhey, you're not getting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.43,0:14:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop staring at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.11,0:14:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you stop following me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.25,0:14:31.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, feather brain,\NI just ate all my food.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.75,0:14:33.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have any more, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.31,0:14:35.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I wouldn't give\Nyou any even if I had some,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.45,0:14:37.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so get lost before I lose my temper.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.59,0:14:40.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is your problem anyhow?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.31,0:14:44.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walking all weird with your big fat\Nmelon head face in the wrong direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.21,0:14:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to have to\Nfight you, bird, but I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.85,0:14:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.05,0:14:56.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In three hours, a mere five of the 81\Npeople on this island will be left standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.83,0:15:00.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only one hour\Nleft until my proclaimed
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.93,0:15:05.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time is up And 25\Nsurvivors currently remain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.83,0:15:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.09,0:15:10.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's Enel doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.77,0:15:13.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.27,0:15:27.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, 24.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.27,0:15:40.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it seems all your\Ntalk doesn't amount to much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.77,0:15:45.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Domain Madagascar!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.03,0:15:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A runic statue.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.23,0:15:57.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ben-Dempleur, commissaire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.01,0:16:14.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long are you going to insist\Non protecting this withered,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.15,0:16:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,good-for-nothing-hold-city?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.49,0:16:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indefinitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.83,0:16:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why must you disrespect what our\Nancestors had held so sacred?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.75,0:16:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The past has nothing to do\Nwith me, so why should I care?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.47,0:16:30.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't surprise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.85,0:16:32.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only the foolish say such things.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.39,0:16:37.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you insult someone so powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.01,0:16:39.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super Punch Mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.99,0:16:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to get away\Nfrom these ruins before
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.25,0:16:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this simpleton destroys\Nwhat's left of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.83,0:16:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I chose to travel with Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.77,0:17:02.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But these ruins could hold\Nthe clues to an unspoken
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.11,0:17:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,history that's been\Nlost to the world below?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.59,0:17:22.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long do you plan on running?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.21,0:17:56.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.51,0:17:58.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You finally decided to face me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.29,0:18:00.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.21,0:18:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.99,0:18:03.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too late?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.05,0:18:07.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if you choose to\Nrepent, I won't forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.97,0:18:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you won't forgive me, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.57,0:18:15.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All because of these\Nshabby old ruins you adore.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.41,0:18:18.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pile of rubble that\Ndoesn't even belong to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.35,0:18:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.71,0:18:22.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those ruins don't belong to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.35,0:18:26.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've grown tired of this, and\NI'm tired of talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.09,0:18:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.77,0:18:31.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In just a few short\Nmoments you won't have to
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.19,0:18:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,talk to me ever again\Nbecause unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.87,0:18:36.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're going to be crushed\Nto death underneath me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.39,0:18:37.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rock Mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.55,0:18:42.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can unleash all of my\Npower on you in this place!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.57,0:18:49.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you do is charge\Naround like a clumsy bull!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.61,0:18:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With no regard for the weight of\Nthe history that you've destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.27,0:18:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.81,0:19:02.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This body's too heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.55,0:19:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll jump you to ribbons!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.43,0:19:23.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Alto Mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.97,0:19:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.27,0:19:27.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.47,0:19:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.59,0:19:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you turn the\Ndials around backwards?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.55,0:19:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.89,0:20:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you have carelessly destroyed\Nwere priceless treasures,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.75,0:20:02.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,relics so rare it would\Nbe next to impossible?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.95,0:20:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to measure their actual worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.53,0:20:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true that history may repeat\Nitself, but people can't go back in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.69,0:20:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A stupid brute like you\Nwouldn't understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.81,0:20:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.73,0:20:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, please, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.83,0:20:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Won't you forgive me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.51,0:20:24.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's out of the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.93,0:20:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, in that case, I'll have\Nto kill you, then won't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.29,0:20:38.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ahh! My fingers! Not my fingers!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.79,0:20:40.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Snow blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.79,0:20:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Delphinium!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.69,0:20:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.53,0:20:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.39,0:20:59.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it's far too late for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.63,0:21:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clutch!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.51,0:21:25.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was certainly unpleasant.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.71,0:21:41.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This should be the center of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.19,0:21:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it doesn't match up at all\Nwith the map on the monitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.09,0:21:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The monitor of the entire city was\Nbroken up and it was thrust into the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.57,0:23:01.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.63,0:23:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could this really be the City of Gold?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.53,0:23:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The size and the topography\Nare all completely different.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.91,0:23:19.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what's most unnatural of all...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.39,0:23:21.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only entrance is at the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.53,0:23:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.03,0:23:59.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I can go below.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.45,0:24:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so vast.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.11,0:24:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ruins really do go much deeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.43,0:24:24.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought it was bizarre that all these\Nblue sea ruins had island clouds for ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.87,0:24:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ruins above are nothing more\Nthan the upper parts of the city,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.21,0:24:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,eaten up by island clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.09,0:24:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's still more below.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.01,0:25:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Light! Light!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.97,0:25:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all so incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.53,0:25:38.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ancient city collapsed 800 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.77,0:25:41.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I can hardly believe\Nit's been that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.19,0:25:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's still so majestic and grand.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.71,0:25:45.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've actually found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.27,0:25:49.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This really is the great\NShandora, a city of gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.33,0:26:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.75,0:26:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.79,0:26:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're saying that it's possible our\Nlost history could actually be uncovered?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.81,0:26:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the Poneglyphs are the key\Nto unlocking these records?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.29,0:26:47.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ancient Poneglyph symbols, so\Nthe Shanks were familiar with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.71,0:26:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But only the ones who made the\NPoneglyphs were able to read them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.63,0:26:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We shall know the true meaning\Nand utter it to no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.03,0:27:00.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's our legacy to be the\Ninheritors of history.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.09,0:27:04.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with the sounding of the Grand Belfry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.57,0:27:07.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.85,0:27:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember Nolan's old logbook\Nmentioning a giant gold bell being here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.55,0:27:14.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if that's true, where could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.43,0:27:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of the city's ancient\Nwritings were burned in a fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.29,0:27:25.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The entire history of\Nthis place was eradicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.73,0:27:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll all manage somehow, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.65,0:27:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've come through this\Nkind of stuff before.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.05,0:27:43.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quit following me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.47,0:27:48.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure goes down a long way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.65,0:27:55.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A poneglyph was carried into the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.39,0:27:57.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no question about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.03,0:27:59.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The city faced great hostility.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.61,0:28:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shandora, the mystical city of gold,\Nfought and fell to protect that poneglyph.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.25,0:28:13.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that means the Grand Belfry located\Nin the center of the Four Altars.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.95,0:28:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could contain the\Ntext of the true history.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.97,0:28:21.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could be the real poneglyph.

